{"id":"f661762c12e8f92b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-rule-lob.md","title":"GL Rule Lob","display":"df-gl-rule-lob — GL Rule Lob","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-rule-lob","aliases":["89-df-gl-rule-lob"],"display":"df-gl-rule-lob — GL Rule Lob","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-rule-lob"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-rule-lob</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-rule-lob — GL Rule Lob"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\Box A\\to A\\rangle,A\\rangle\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal R_L\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\Box A\\to A\\rangle,A\\rangle\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal R_L\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Löb 规则由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box A\\to A\">\\(\\Box A\\to A\\)</span> 推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；它在 GL 中可容许，但不是原始推理规则。</li>\n<li>该规则的可容许性由 GL 内的 Löb 公理与 MP 推出；框架刻画属于\n另一个语义定理，不能把规则本身直接定义为“逆良基性”。</li>\n<li>Lob规则与 Lob 定理相关</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-formula]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}rule\\text{-}lob}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\langle\\Box A\\to A\\rangle,A\\rangle\\mid\nA\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathcal R_L\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":960,"backlinks":[{"id":"6c54ff0b5f31df9f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{R}_{L}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the admissible Löb-rule relation (see [[89-df-gl-rule-lob]])."},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-297","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-rule-lob]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","d246470e97fec132","32c9990061b9749d"]}